### The Breve Mark ˘

When {{ vowel }} says its short sound /{{ vowel_sound }}/, we can mark it with a **breve** (˘) — a little smile above the letter. This helps us remember it's the short sound.

> {{ vowel }}̄  = long &nbsp;&nbsp;|&nbsp;&nbsp; {{ vowel }}̆ = short (breve)

